  "stageId": "act18d3_08",
  "title": "親族",
  "storyCode": "SV-8",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2fc29f6901eeec4c9f6c00af341e60396638658c730b9030ca8deb79e336c925",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "雜種......你們兩個雜種——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "使者！你在做什麼？！你為什麼留住她們？她們怎麼值得你這麼做？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "在她們對我們同胞大肆殺戮的時候，你們就該意識到她們和你絕對不是一種東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你是神聖的生命！她們只是污濁的殘渣！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "（啐）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "很會適應，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "我們用冷兵器去砍殺你們，讓你們對技術不那麼敏感，不讓你們進化成其他手段也解決不了的樣子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "現在我卻高估你了。你太不敏感了......這都適應不了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "看起來你習慣不了阿戈爾材料學造出來的刀刃。是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "使者，她在污衊你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "主教，主教......你還看不出嗎？呵呵，是的，我就是有自信殺了你。我從最開始就能殺掉你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "（低鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "嗚......（咳嗽）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "兄弟，你為什麼不接受？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "她們都是我姐妹。所以她們也是你姐妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "我能喚起你，喚起Ishar-mla，當然......也喚起Gla-dia。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "你因為你兄弟，游向淺海，就不認他，那樣只是......不在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "我們，族群，都在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "不......妄言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "你難道相信過你手中經書的任何字句？允我提醒，你也是在伊比利亞的眼皮底下宣傳邪說，主教。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "它說什麼我都無所謂，可你，深海教會的人，是不是把他的話都用本子記下來會比較好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "殺了他們......殺了她們！使者！動手！她們犯下了大罪！他們褻瀆了你，褻瀆了海洋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "你這樣要求......我真會這麼做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "你也無所謂，對嗎？就像你和我說的一樣，我這麼要求也沒問題！你會殺了她們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "是的。我依然無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "先去殺了那個......吟遊歌手。把那個紅衣服的先殺掉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "垃圾。是不是我讓你去殺掉你身後的人，殺了你身後穿得像條海帶的主教，你也會這麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "......！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "因為他是我同胞，你也是我同胞。他在呼喚我，你也在呼喚我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "人類啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "阿戈爾人可真是又卑劣又醜陋。承認吧，主教。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "我們都是些愚蠢的阿戈爾人，喜歡把自己的想法去套在畜生身上。你根本不懂它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主教",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_184",
      "text": "雜種！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "只不過，如果你想保護我們的生命——為什麼不拒絕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "拒絕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "怎麼樣......拒絕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "行了，的確是劣等生物。你只游到這個深度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "但是，垃圾，聽好，我不會開口請你去殺你背後那個軟蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "你只是獵物。誰會懇求自己的獵物？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "你想動她？你聽從他的建議，想殺斯卡蒂，我的獵人？你不想再要那個答案了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "殺了她也有其他辦法。只要還有辦法，我就無所謂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "但你說的，拒絕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "太早了。咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "（咳血）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "呸。我不管你。你想殺她——你得先過我這關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "那麼，Gla-dia。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "你的生命能不能延續，你肉體以後還能不能活動，你來選能還是不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "text": "用相互獵殺來選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海嗣",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_186",
      "text": "相互......相互。是的。用相互捕食來選。你捕食我。我捕食你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
